                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4c66a18f-eb46-3246-97c3-82e9d3d32f5e",
                        "entry_id": "225a08ca-dff7-3f84-ad69-a64aaa9fff06",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Caractère de ce qui est pluriversel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e1dce3b-cd18-4823-a456-d48d0ec65130",
                                "sense_id": "4c66a18f-eb46-3246-97c3-82e9d3d32f5e",
                                "text": "Brillant, le verbe haut et élégant, Patrick Chamoiseau y développe une vision déstabilisante sur le futur du monde, le devoir d’accueil et le partage. Pluriversalité au lieu d’universalité. Depuis des années, ce rituel de la critique de la raison occidentale m’agace."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce9204b2-7041-44d1-a59b-1e8d55ed96fd",
                        "source_entry_id": "225a08ca-dff7-3f84-ad69-a64aaa9fff06",
                        "source_sense_id": "4c66a18f-eb46-3246-97c3-82e9d3d32f5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "pluriversality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pluriversality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b82d388-fb7d-3e22-928c-dac71f2158d4",
                                        "entry_id": "7ac8d023-b432-3582-bd2e-25b3685e5bd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being pluriversal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "225fda61-bfcd-405b-81a6-0a2fc5705f64",
                                                "sense_id": "5b82d388-fb7d-3e22-928c-dac71f2158d4",
                                                "text": "As an antidote, border thinking aims at pluriversality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bead532-dc3e-41a5-a523-b6ca3d388868",
                                                "sense_id": "5b82d388-fb7d-3e22-928c-dac71f2158d4",
                                                "text": "Those conditions of possibility enabled me to move with more intensity from a perspective of universality toward a perspective of pluriversality, from modernity toward transmodernity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4efb49aa-2e53-4e86-8b6c-80d260bcb9d5",
                                                "sense_id": "5b82d388-fb7d-3e22-928c-dac71f2158d4",
                                                "text": "For scholars of engagement the rich space that is created by such a differential movement related to pluriversality suggests opportunities for research based on multiple knowledges reflecting the multiple global forces and options described by Mignolo (see also Shulz, 2012)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d67e7860-c146-3257-8b9c-5163fd2a1312",
                                        "entry_id": "7ac8d023-b432-3582-bd2e-25b3685e5bd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state or situation that is pluriversal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32bc43a5-3821-46f0-ab71-dab22d945551",
                                                "sense_id": "d67e7860-c146-3257-8b9c-5163fd2a1312",
                                                "text": "Secondly, it is important to reassert collective resilience for action to transform and construct a Europe of and for the people, one in which social justice, intense democratic values, inalienable human rights and the recognition of the pluriversalities of human dignity are primary motives for integration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fb4c7ff-1f3a-4e2f-87fc-5e64563cf220",
                                                "sense_id": "d67e7860-c146-3257-8b9c-5163fd2a1312",
                                                "text": "By highlighting the existence of various different yet converging modernities that are disentangled from specific temporal and geographical setups, the texts suggest that there has never been only one history that can be interpreted and written in one particular way, but a pluriversality of approaches to the past – a pluriversality that has to be critically examined, but can also be joyfully celebrated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a92b03e-0ad9-4688-847a-912dc9bff016",
                                                "sense_id": "d67e7860-c146-3257-8b9c-5163fd2a1312",
                                                "text": "The three positions described above—color blindness, counting diverse bodies, and enabling pluriversalities—describe different approaches to engaging questions of diversity in higher education, but there is much still to be done."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
